    info:{ en:'A vast Qing imperial garden, once called the “Garden of Gardens”. In 1860 British and French troops looted it and set it on fire; today its ruins remind people never to forget.', zh:'清朝皇家园林，被誉为“万园之园”。1860年英法联军把它洗劫一空并放火焚烧，今天的遗址警示后人勿忘国耻。' },
