    info:{ en:'The peninsula across the harbour from Hong Kong Island. Britain took its southern tip in 1860; China resumed sovereignty over all of Hong Kong in 1997.', zh:'与香港岛隔海相望的半岛。1860年英国割占九龙司地方一区，1997年中国恢复对香港行使主权。' },
